Yes!

00:24:00.060 --> 00:24:20.040
NEXT EPISODE

00:24:00.060 --> 00:24:20.040
THE TERRIFYING CITY

00:24:00.680 --> 00:24:03.500
I am Snek,
Class A, rank 38!

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:07.070
A lot of guys think
my name is “Snake,”

00:24:07.070 --> 00:24:08.610
but it's Snek,
so don't forget it!

00:24:08.610 --> 00:24:11.700
Next on One-Punch Man
is episode 6,
The Terrifying City

00:24:11.700 --> 00:24:15.370
There's time left?
Well, I'm fully
aware of that.

00:24:15.370 --> 00:24:16.870
That's right!
In this industry,

00:24:16.870 --> 00:24:19.710
there's such a thing
as killing time with
episode previews!
